<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 600px;">
  <p>Hi <strong>{{ contact_first_name or (company_name ~ " team") }}</strong>,</p>

  <p>I came across your business and wanted to reach out directly.</p>

  <p>At <strong>{{ sender.company }}</strong>, we help businesses improve their online presence and customer engagement through modern digital and AI-powered solutions. Whether you're looking to redesign your website, improve performance, or automate customer interactions, we can help.</p>

  <p><strong>Our services include:</strong></p>
  <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Website Design &amp; Redesign</li>
    <li>Website Support &amp; Maintenance</li>
    <li>AI Chatbots &amp; AI Voice Agents</li>
    <li>SEO, AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) &amp; LLM Visibility</li>
    <li>ChatGPT-powered Business Applications</li>
    <li>Digital Marketing &amp; Lead Generation</li>
    <li>Custom AI &amp; Business Automation Solutions</li>
  </ul>

  <p>{{ ai_hook or "Our focus is on helping businesses generate more leads, improve customer experience, and stay competitive as more customers discover businesses through AI platforms like ChatGPT and other large language models." }}</p>

  <p><strong>You can learn more about us at: <a href="{{ sender.landing_page or sender.website }}" style="color:#2563eb;">{{ sender.landing_page or sender.website }}</a></strong></p>

  <p>If you're considering upgrading your digital presence or exploring how AI can benefit your business, I'd be happy to arrange a quick, no-obligation discussion to understand your goals and share some ideas.</p>

  <p>Looking forward to connecting.</p>

  <p>Regards,</p>

  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation" style="margin: 8px 0 24px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding-right: 18px; vertical-align: top;">
        <img src="cid:webify_logo_signature" width="88" alt="{{ sender.company }}" style="display: block; width: 88px;">
      </td>
      <td style="border-left: 3px solid #1e2a4a; padding-left: 18px; vertical-align: top;">
        <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: .02em; color: #111827; text-transform: uppercase;">{{ sender.first_name }} {{ sender.last_name }}</div>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #111827; margin-top: 2px;">{{ sender.designation }} - {{ sender.company }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #374151; margin-top: 6px;">
          &#9993;&#65039; <a href="mailto:{{ sender.signature_email or sender.email }}" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">{{ sender.signature_email or sender.email }}</a>
          &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          &#128222; {{ sender.phone }}
        </div>

        <!-- Horizontal rule echoing the vertical one beside the logo. -->
        <div style="border-top: 2px solid #1e2a4a; margin: 12px 0 10px; width: 340px; max-width: 100%;"></div>

        <div style="font-size: 13px;">
          {%- if sender.linkedin_url %}
          <a href="{{ sender.linkedin_url }}" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">LinkedIn</a>
          &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          {%- endif %}
          <a href="{{ sender.bot_store_url }}" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Webify Bot Store</a>
        </div>
        {%- if sender.bot_store_title %}
        <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;">
          <a href="{{ sender.bot_store_url }}" style="color: #1e2a4a; text-decoration: none;">{{ sender.bot_store_title }}</a>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 2px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; max-width: 430px;">{{ sender.bot_store_blurb }}</div>
        {%- endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #374151; margin-top: 4px;">
    ** If this is not relevant or you'd prefer not to hear from us again, simply reply <strong>&quot;Opt Out&quot;</strong> and we'll remove you from future communication. We respect your privacy and do not share your information. **
  </p>
</div>
